{"id":"4718","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4718_main_cirrus-spissatus-mamma-and-cirrus-floccus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>在表面冷锋通路后，是密集的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>云片。这些云片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">横向</span>于上层风而对齐，并且还显示出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">对流发展</span>的迹象，表明它们的水平不稳定。在发展的初始阶段，一种独特的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">带有尾迹的絮状卷云云片</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状卷云</span>证实了这一点。一些不明显的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状云</span>更说明了这一点。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛圣布雷拉德","latitude":"纬度: 49° 10' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 10' 9'' W","date":"22 June 2015 1954 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.4"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/4718_syn_cirrus-spissatus-mamma-and-cirrus-floccus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在冷锋消散前三小时，一股较弱的西向西北极地海上气流覆盖了该地区。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4718_upper_cirrus-spissatus-mamma-and-cirrus-floccus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>从4000到7500米的湿度非常高。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/4718_sat_cirrus-spissatus-mamma-and-cirrus-floccus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"></div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2014","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4702_main_parhelic-circle-and-120-parhelion_clouds-photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这张照片显示了 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛卷层云</span>和 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>，以及 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处的一些飞机凝结尾迹（人为衍生卷云）。然而，还有两个特别重要的发光陨星。</p>\n<p>第一个是照片中心附近的亮点；这是一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">120°假日</span>，由至少两个阳光内部冰晶反射引起。进入板晶体顶面的光线在两个相邻的侧面内部反射，然后穿过较低面。在这种情况下，看不到第二个120°假日。在拍摄时，太阳的方位角是274°，并且假日的方位角是034°（与太阳的方位角距离为120°）。</p>\n<p>第二个大气现象是一个穿过120°假日的白色带；这是一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">幻日环</span>。 幻日环是一个环绕天空的白色水平圆环，与太阳在地平线上方的角度相同。许多冰晶的垂直面分别在天空周围形成反射太阳以形成圆环。这一天只能看见圆环的一部分。水平带的高度为地平线上方020°。在这些现象出现时，也可以看到明亮的环天弧顶，但是在这张照片中看不到。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛泽西机场","latitude":"纬度: 49° 12' 27'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 11' 43'' W","date":"02 August 2010 1836 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 6","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.6"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4797_main_cirrus-spissatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>图像显示的是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处的密集斑块形式的卷云，其为典型的密云云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stefan Kämpfe","location":"德国图林根州魏玛","latitude":"纬度: 51° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 11° 0' 0'' E","date":"05 November 2011 1000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.4 2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.4 2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4813_main_cirrus-spissatus-and-fibratus-with-partial-22-solar-halo_clouds-photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>该图像中的显著特征是在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛卷云</span>中发生的部分<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">22°光晕</span>。密卷云开始变厚，但是当看向太阳时，它还不够厚，看起来很灰。纤维细丝不规则弯曲或接近直；是白色的；并且具有比纤维（毛发状）外观更<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">柔滑的光泽</span>。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>处也可以看到几个凝结尾迹。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Danny Krull","location":"德国，01844 Neustadt in Sachsen, Polenz","latitude":"纬度: 51° 1' 37'' N","longitude":"经度: 14° 12' 3'' E","date":"16 September 2012 1059 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.4 40","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.4 40"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4825_main_cirrus-spissatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc8\"><p>这张照片显示了广泛而美丽的密集的卷云（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密云</span>云种），起源于一个微弱和不断衰减的暖锋。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国康沃尔郡特鲁罗","latitude":"纬度: 50° 12' 35'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 5' 23'' W","date":"07 August 2005 1821 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.4 1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.4 1"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4517_main_cirrus-spissatus-with-virga_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc9\"><p>这些卷云斑块非常密集，因此属于密卷云种类。从这些斑块下方看，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">在位置1</span><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">和2</span>处，有一些幡状云垂悬在卷云层下方较弱的风中。一个与卷云无关的浓积云云顶<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">在位置3</span>可见。</p>\n<p>一条静止锋位于东北方约300公里处，呈西北-东南走向，西南方则有反气旋正在形成。</p></div>","copyright":"© R.K. Pilsbury","location":"Christchurch, Hampshire,United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland","latitude":"纬度: 50° 46' 13'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 44' 42'' W","date":"25 October 1978 1100 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4504_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulogenitus-with-virga_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc10\"><p>这团积雨云已几乎完全从早期的水滴形态转变为冰云。其纤维状上部<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">位于1处</span>，几乎延伸至可见云体的底部，在那里可见一小片上升气流区域<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">位于2处</span>。在这个干燥大气环境中，雨幡几乎已触及地面<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">位于3处</span>。该区域当时正受到低层干燥气流和下午强烈昼夜加热的影响。</p></div>","copyright":"© S.M. Holle","location":"Des Moines, New Mexico, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 36° 45' 40'' N","longitude":"经度: 103° 50' 3'' W","date":"30 July 1977 1130 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}